1
00:00:06,760 --> 00:00:10,820
梅德韦杰夫收获本赛季第三冠
Medvedev claims a third title of the season.

2
00:00:11,120 --> 00:00:12,860
是的 这是一届很棒的比赛
Yeah, it was a great tournament.

3
00:00:12,860 --> 00:00:14,080
很开心 很有意思
Fun, fun one.

4
00:00:14,080 --> 00:00:14,960
也打了几场好球
Some good matches.

5
00:00:15,750 --> 00:00:17,100
感觉自己打得不错
Felt some good tennis.

6
00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:18,640
今天发球也很好
And today I served pretty well.

7
00:00:18,640 --> 00:00:20,240
对此我很满意
So really happy about it.

8
00:00:20,240 --> 00:00:22,900
能拿到冠军 真的很开心
And, yeah, happy, happy to get the title.

9
00:00:23,080 --> 00:00:25,980
这对你来说也很有意义
And it's really something meaningful for you

10
00:00:25,980 --> 00:00:28,360
和自己的同胞交手
to play against your compatriot.

11
00:00:28,920 --> 00:00:30,500
你此前也曾
You had a previous experience

12
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:32,640
在决赛里和他交过手
of taking on him in a final.

13
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:33,980
而且赢下了那场比赛
And you won that one.

14
00:00:33,980 --> 00:00:37,020
这次你也再次
And also you are the... you're the one

15
00:00:37,020 --> 00:00:39,420
成为决赛的获胜者
who stands in this final.

16
00:00:39,420 --> 00:00:42,040
这场决赛对你意味着什么？
So how does this final mean to you?

17
00:00:42,040 --> 00:00:42,820
是的 我想说
Yeah, I mean,

18
00:00:42,820 --> 00:00:43,740
这从来都不容易
it's never easy to play

19
00:00:43,740 --> 00:00:44,660
和自己的同胞比赛
someone from your country.

20
00:00:44,660 --> 00:00:47,040
总会比平时更在意一点
There is always a tiny bit more on the line.

21
00:00:47,040 --> 00:00:48,920
虽然说到底 对手是谁并不重要
Even if, in the end, we don't care —

22
00:00:48,920 --> 00:00:49,960
决赛无论对谁
whoever you play in the final,

23
00:00:49,960 --> 00:00:50,580
你都想赢
you want to win.

24
00:00:50,580 --> 00:00:52,300
但和同胞交手 还是更在意一些
But there's a tiny bit more on the line.

25
00:00:52,300 --> 00:00:53,940
所以肯定会更紧张
So, for sure, a lot more nerves.

26
00:00:54,580 --> 00:00:56,840
我觉得自己处理得不错
And I think I handled it well.

27
00:00:56,940 --> 00:00:58,500
关键时刻 我打得很好
I played good in important moments.

28
00:00:58,500 --> 00:01:00,080
我对自己的表现很满意
And I'm really happy about my level.

29
00:01:01,240 --> 00:01:02,620
梅德韦杰夫又夺冠了
Medvedev, a champion

30
00:01:02,620 --> 00:01:05,880
这是他夺冠的第23座不同城市
in a 23rd different city.

31
00:01:06,620 --> 00:01:09,360
他的冠军履历多么丰富
What a portfolio this man possesses.

32
00:01:11,480 --> 00:01:13,720
他是杭州最后的赢家
The last man standing in Hangzhou.
